+| Variable | Default | Notes |
+|----------|---------|-------|
+| `APP_ENV` | development | `development` \| `stage` \| `production` |
+| `NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_ENV` | development | Клиентский env label |
+| `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL` | http://localhost:3000 | **R** prod — canonical URL |
